  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Three approaches to the same question: which routes are heavy hitters, and which are new?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>generator-a/b</b><br><small>sources A and B</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>branch-a/b</b><br><small>Count-Min 4&times;512 + top-20 heap per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>merge</b><br><small>both sources&#39; sketches per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>detector</b><br><small>top-20 with bounds; new heavy hitters</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>query: method=&quot;sketch&quot;</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-branch-a/b</b><br><small>route &rarr; count map per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-merge</b><br><small>adds both sources&#39; maps: every key</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-detector</b><br><small>exact top-20; new heavy hitters</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>query: method=&quot;exact&quot;</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>raw-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>raw-sink-a/b</b><br><small>the only stage: every point into the log store</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>loki-raw</b><br><small>stores every raw point</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>query-job</b><br><small>LogQL top-20 once per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>answer: method=&quot;raw&quot;</small></div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Every stage is one pinned container. Traffic grows over 30 minutes: the rate per source doubles every 5 minutes (5k to 80k points/s), <code>/new/hot-route</code> takes 15% of traffic at minute 10, and the number of routes grows from 100,000 to 1,000,000 at minute 15. hh-accuracy compares the sketch with exact; query-job compares store and query with exact and times every approach's backend query.</small></p>"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
